Third-party components and assets:

- Electron (MIT) - https://github.com/electron/electron
- React (MIT) - https://github.com/facebook/react
- pixi.js (MIT) / pixi-live2d-display (MIT) - optional Live2D rendering path.
  Live2D Cubism Core and any Live2D model files are NOT redistributed by this
  project; bring your own model and accept Live2D, Inc.'s license terms.
- sherpa-onnx (Apache-2.0) - optional local TTS runtime, installed from npm.
  The Matcha-TTS voice pack is downloaded on demand from a public mirror and is
  covered by its own licenses: model/runtime Apache-2.0, espeak-ng-data GPL-3.0.
